WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:06.880
SPEAKER: Companies of all shapes
and sizes across industries

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.560
and geographies
have dramatically

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:11.360
accelerated the adoption
of digital during 2020.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.690
As a result, digital
transformation journeys

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.730
have been forced to
accelerate over this period,

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:18.220
with years of transformation
being pushed forward

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.320
within just a few months.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.060
As APIs are the
fundamental building

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.250
blocks of any digital
transformation program,

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.260
we at Google Cloud set
out to better understand

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.840
the ways in which enterprises
have tracked, deployed,

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.690
monitored, and
managed APIs in 2020.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.610
After careful
investigation of this data,

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:35.320
we published a very
insightful report

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.350
that speaks to the state
of API economy in 2021.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:41.050
This report brings together
an in-depth analysis

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.930
of over 2 trillion API
calls to better understand

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:47.650
usage behavior on the Apigee
API Management Platform,

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.740
a detailed study of customer
use cases seen across GOs

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:53.770
and industries in 2020,
and findings from a survey

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:56.230
administered to over
700 technology leaders

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:57.980
from enterprises
around the world.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:59.830
Let's take a look
at the findings.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:03.550
During the last year, despite
the pandemic, nearly 75%

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:05.560
of companies studied
continued focusing

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.810
on their digital
transformation initiatives.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.610
And almost 2/3 of
those companies

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:12.220
actually increased their
investments and efforts.

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:14.020
We also saw a
perfect correlation

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:15.730
between the growth
of API traffic

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:17.620
on Apigee and
increased investments

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:19.570
in digital
transformation programs.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.190
Just in 2020, Apigee saw a
whopping 46% year-over-year API

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:27.750
traffic growth, with traffic
volume hitting an all-time high

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.240
of 2.2 trillion calls.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:32.370
With heightened
levels of API usage,

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:35.490
security and privacy of APIs
were of utmost importance

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:37.050
to enterprises.

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:39.960
As a result, anomaly
detection, bot protection,

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:43.260
and security analytics
usage grew by over 230%

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:45.180
across Apigee customers.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:48.930
And API analytics adoption
increased by over 75%

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:50.800
among Apigee customers.

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:54.450
API security, API
analytics, and API traffic

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:56.820
are just some of the ways
enterprises are investing

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:58.680
in their API
programs as they work

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:01.830
to accelerate their digital
transformation programs.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:04.080
If you want to learn about
other areas of investment,

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:06.120
then the State of
API Economy Report

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:08.020
is the perfect place to start.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:10.199
You can download the
executive summary here

00:02:10.199 --> 00:02:16.140
at goo.gle/execsumstateofapis,
or download the full State

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:21.060
of API Economy Report here
at goo.gle/stateofapis.

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:24.120
If you want to talk to a Cloud
value advisor about the report

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:26.400
and what the findings
mean to your enterprise,

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:30.540
then ping us at
cloud.google.com/contact.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.850
We hope you enjoyed the
report and we look forward

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:34.590
to connecting with
you at the earliest.

